node_modules/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
# ...and the SLASHLESS form. A trailing-slash pattern matches DIRECTORIES
# only, so moving the generated project onto external storage and leaving a
# symlink behind makes git see an untracked FILE here — and a symlink with an
# absolute machine path is exactly what broke CI's module census when it
# happened to node_modules at the repo root (see the root .gitignore).
src-tauri/gen
# Generated from build.rs AppManifest on every Cargo build. The manifest and
# structural gate are the source of truth; do not commit machine-generated ACL
# TOML files.
src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/
# Tauri generated mobile projects are re-generatable via `tauri {ios,android} init`.
